            0.243,
            0.762,
            0.54,
            0.819
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "thus, saving forests. One such effort is the famous Chipko movement. It started in the"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.796,
            0.224,
            0.844
          ],
          "content": [
            {
